.
.  Generate sample output for confidence limits
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
.
set ipl1na ansco1.ps
device 2 postscript
.
skip 25
read anscombe.dat x1 y1
fit y1 x1
label size 3
title size 3
tic label size 3
character hw 3 2.25
character circle BLANK
character fill on
line blank solid
plot y1 x1 and
plot pred x1
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv ANSCO1.PS ansco1.ps
.
. quit
